     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi everyone,<div><br></div><div>I want to get my head into prior regularization for the Bayesian occupancy models, I have read several papers on it including <a href=\"https://esajournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1890/14-0661.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://esajournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1890/14-0661.1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449374465000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XYuJEsbrFZxeGCVsonRyq\">Hooten &amp; Hobbs, 2015</a>; <a href=\"https://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1111/2041-210X.12368\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1111/2041-210X.12368&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449374465000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2nOVCNg1_9Vxg_la0oKXxI\">Hutchinson et al., 2015</a> and <a href=\"https://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0192819#pone.0192819.s007\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id%3D10.1371/journal.pone.0192819%23pone.0192819.s007&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449374465000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0a4yDAe2hSajsOqr1efBh9\">Northrup &amp; Gerber 2018</a>. I kind of understood the idea, however, I am still struggling a little bit to implement it in my code. I also did not encounter any code examples so far. If anyone has an example code on prior regularization (preferably occupancy modeling but any would do) and would like to share it I&#39;d be really grateful.<br><div><div><br></div><div>Thank you in advance.</div><div>Best,</div><div>Dilsad</div><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font color=\"#000000\">A. Dilsad Dagtekin</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\" size=\"1\">PhD Student at </font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:x-small\">Population Ecology Research Group</font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:x-small\">University of Zurich,</span><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:x-small\"> </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:x-small\">Department of Evolutionary Biology and Environmental Studies </span></div><div><font size=\"1\" color=\"#000000\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dilsad....@ieu.uzh.ch</a> | <a href=\"http://www.popecol.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.popecol.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449374466000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1_i7Gv93IRI2As0WQHKFqR\">www.popecol.org</a></font></div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">Ecology and Evol. Biology Society of Turkey: <a href=\"http://www.ekoevo.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.ekoevo.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449374466000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3l0g7OPAL-MQZVgWEjjSGy\">www.ekoevo.org</a></font><br><font size=\"1\" color=\"#666666\">ITU Alumni &#39;16 &amp; &#39;18 | AFS Alumni &#39;12</font></font><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
